    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Awaken amidst the shattered remnants of the Forgotten Lands --- inscribe your laws of survival with magic. Each cycle weaves a new symphony of power.&quot;\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic-themed Action RPG | Development Purpose: <strong>Unreal Engine learning project for me</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dimensional rift consumed your memories, leaving you stranded in the Mystic Wastes - a cursed expanse teeming with spectral horrors. As celestial anomalies bind time in endless loops, forge your path through cycles of combat against Realmkeepers. Unearth arcane secrets scattered across this ever-resetting continent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Loop</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRoguelite Progression:\u200b</strong>\u200b Battle through \u200b<strong>\u200bmultiple procedurally generated maps\u200b</strong>\u200b, defeating enemies to \u200b<strong>\u200bgain EXP and coins\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bMeta Progression:\u200b</strong>\u200b Use coins \u200b<strong>\u200bbetween runs\u200b</strong>\u200b to permanently upgrade stats, unlocking \u200b<strong>\u200bnew zones or higher difficulties\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bTime-Loop Mechanic:\u200b</strong>\u200b Each reset (&quot;cycle&quot;) reshapes the world, offering fresh challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Awaken amidst the shattered remnants of the Forgotten Lands --- inscribe your laws of survival with magic. Each cycle weaves a new symphony of power.&quot;\u200b</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic-themed Action RPG | Development Purpose: <strong>Unreal Engine learning project for me</strong>.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Premise</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A dimensional rift consumed your memories, leaving you stranded in the Mystic Wastes - a cursed expanse teeming with spectral horrors. As celestial anomalies bind time in endless loops, forge your path through cycles of combat against Realmkeepers. Unearth arcane secrets scattered across this ever-resetting continent...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay Loop</strong>\u200b</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bRoguelite Progression:\u200b</strong>\u200b Battle through \u200b<strong>\u200bmultiple procedurally generated maps\u200b</strong>\u200b, defeating enemies to \u200b<strong>\u200bgain EXP and coins\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bMeta Progression:\u200b</strong>\u200b Use coins \u200b<strong>\u200bbetween runs\u200b</strong>\u200b to permanently upgrade stats, unlocking \u200b<strong>\u200bnew zones or higher difficulties\u200b</strong>\u200b.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200b<strong>\u200bTime-Loop Mechanic:\u200b</strong>\u200b Each reset (&quot;cycle&quot;) reshapes the world, offering fresh challenges.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "a Magic-themed Action RPG. \u200b\u200bBattle through \u200b\u200bmultiple procedurally generated maps\u200b\u200b, defeating enemies to \u200b\u200bgain EXP and coins\u200b\u200b, then use coins \u200b\u200bbetween runs\u200b\u200b to permanently upgrade stats, unlocking \u200b\u200bnew zones or higher difficulties\u200b\u200b.",
